    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/5538383fa89373fe6ce31a410f192cf2.poster.avif?t=1751658944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/5538383fa89373fe6ce31a410f192cf2.webm?t=1751658944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/5538383fa89373fe6ce31a410f192cf2.mp4?t=1751658944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>(THIS IS AN IDLE GAME =&gt; THIS GAME YOU PLAY BY BEING AFK)<br>(STAY AWAY FROM THIS GAME IF YOU DONT LIKE IDLERS)<br>(THERE IS NO ACTION IN THIS GAME , EVERYTHING IS AUTOMATED)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/0af40ecc1089c920b12943ecbecb1d1d.avif?t=1751658944\" /></div><br><br><strong>Hello community!</strong><br><br>I promissed you guys I would be coming with a FTP game as an apology for the disaster that was KnC...<br>So!! Here I am again! Well I made a new game on GMS(Gamemaker Studio)<br>I need to master this game engine! Hopefully I can do you justice this time around.<br><br>(DLC isnt necessary...) <br>Buy it if you want to support me!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/f4e741f528f7265248a4c65454348f89.avif?t=1751658944\" /></div><br><br>1.1 <strong>This is an IDLE game...</strong> <br><br>This is a game where the game plays by itself.. you take almost no action.<br>Yes I know!! There are several fans of this new game genre all across the web...<br>I am making these games for them. If you like games with action such <br>as platformers. You may not like this game. <br>This is a game for people to try to figure out the best builds to max theyr stats the quickest way possible.. <br>The beauty of IDLE games is that you dont need to click the same buttons <br>or take the same actions over and over again.. everything is done automatically...<br><br>1.2 This is an IDLE game inspired by all those RPGS we play... In this game you will be maxing several stats<br>and crafting equipment and improving them to move further in the Battle Zones.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/5f7b7448b8c5994dcdc59b943976fd78.avif?t=1751658944\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 180 Equips !<br></li><li> Equips are randomly generated...<br></li><li> You can merge all your equips with the FORGE ALL button.<br></li><li> You can enchant and socket your equipment.<br></li><li> Animated Battles(They are actually just 2 chars walking)<br></li><li> A Town scene.<br></li><li> Talent points to master your abilities</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/5538383fa89373fe6ce31a410f192cf2.poster.avif?t=1751658944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/5538383fa89373fe6ce31a410f192cf2.webm?t=1751658944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/5538383fa89373fe6ce31a410f192cf2.mp4?t=1751658944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>(THIS IS AN IDLE GAME =&gt; THIS GAME YOU PLAY BY BEING AFK)<br>(STAY AWAY FROM THIS GAME IF YOU DONT LIKE IDLERS)<br>(THERE IS NO ACTION IN THIS GAME , EVERYTHING IS AUTOMATED)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/0af40ecc1089c920b12943ecbecb1d1d.avif?t=1751658944\" /></div><br><br><strong>Hello community!</strong><br><br>I promissed you guys I would be coming with a FTP game as an apology for the disaster that was KnC...<br>So!! Here I am again! Well I made a new game on GMS(Gamemaker Studio)<br>I need to master this game engine! Hopefully I can do you justice this time around.<br><br>(DLC isnt necessary...) <br>Buy it if you want to support me!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/f4e741f528f7265248a4c65454348f89.avif?t=1751658944\" /></div><br><br>1.1 <strong>This is an IDLE game...</strong> <br><br>This is a game where the game plays by itself.. you take almost no action.<br>Yes I know!! There are several fans of this new game genre all across the web...<br>I am making these games for them. If you like games with action such <br>as platformers. You may not like this game. <br>This is a game for people to try to figure out the best builds to max theyr stats the quickest way possible.. <br>The beauty of IDLE games is that you dont need to click the same buttons <br>or take the same actions over and over again.. everything is done automatically...<br><br>1.2 This is an IDLE game inspired by all those RPGS we play... In this game you will be maxing several stats<br>and crafting equipment and improving them to move further in the Battle Zones.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2137770/extras/5f7b7448b8c5994dcdc59b943976fd78.avif?t=1751658944\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 180 Equips !<br></li><li> Equips are randomly generated...<br></li><li> You can merge all your equips with the FORGE ALL button.<br></li><li> You can enchant and socket your equipment.<br></li><li> Animated Battles(They are actually just 2 chars walking)<br></li><li> A Town scene.<br></li><li> Talent points to master your abilities</li></ul>",
